@shop = http://localhost:8080
@slug = seed-product-7

### 1. Admin token (needed for /actuator/metrics)
# @name shopAdmin
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/ecommerce/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=ecommerce-cli&username=shop-admin&password=shop-admin

### 2. View the product page: FIRST time → cache miss, the shop log shows a SELECT
# @name view
GET {{shop}}/api/v1/products/{{slug}}

### 3. View it again (send this 3-4 times) → cache hit, NO select in the log
GET {{shop}}/api/v1/products/{{slug}}

### 4. How many hits?
GET {{shop}}/actuator/metrics/cache.gets?tag=name:productPages&tag=result:hit
Authorization: Bearer {{shopAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### 5. How many misses?
GET {{shop}}/actuator/metrics/cache.gets?tag=name:productPages&tag=result:miss
Authorization: Bearer {{shopAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### 6. Conditional GET with the ETag from request 2 → 304 Not Modified, empty body
GET {{shop}}/api/v1/products/{{slug}}
If-None-Match: {{view.response.headers.ETag}}